{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-p032a","title":"司马懿等奏汉德已衰请受命","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-p032a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"司马懿等奏汉德已衰请受命","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0085","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0073","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0086","role":"奏议","evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年癸丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年癸丑"},"evidence":["wendi-e-p032a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-p032a-q","source_order":[2,145,"P032a"],"order":520}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0084","name":"郑浑","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0085","name":"羊祕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0086","name":"武周","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0073","name":"鲍勋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-p032a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-672630f578f395129508","layer":"pei","quote":"癸丑，宣告群僚。督军御史中丞司马懿，侍御史郑浑、羊祕、鲍勋、武周等言：“令如左。伏读太史丞许芝上符命事。臣等闻有唐世衰，天命在虞；虞氏世衰，天命在夏。然则天地之灵，历数之运，去就之符，惟德所在。故孔子曰：‘凤鸟不至，河不出《图》，吾已矣夫！’今汉室衰，自安、和、冲、质以来，国统屡绝；桓、灵荒淫，禄去公室。此乃天命去就，非一朝一夕，其所由来久矣。殿下践阼，至德广被，格于上下；天人感应，符瑞并臻。考之旧史，未有若今日之盛。夫大人者，先天而天弗违；后天而奉天时。天时已至而犹谦让者，舜、禹所不为也；故生民蒙救济之惠，群类受育长之施。今八方颙颙，大小注望；皇天乃眷，神人同谋；十分而九以委质，义过周文，所谓过恭也。臣妾上下，伏所不安。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":316,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
